# Migration Manifest
# Generated during infrastructure restructuring
# Format: OLD_PATH -> NEW_PATH
# Special markers: REMOVED (target intentionally deleted), CREATE_DIR (target directory needs creation)
# Prefix matching: a directory mapping applies to all contents beneath it

